  "description": "The WebRTC signaling relay Rask's ISignaling client connects to — rooms, server-minted peer ids, and opaque payload relay between peers, with authorization, size and rate limits. Depends on nothing from Rask.Server: any ASP.NET host can map it, including a static-file host serving a published WASM bundle. The relay never parses an SDP or an ICE candidate; it forwards whatever the client sent to one named peer in the same room.",
